the stacking like this is readability only, but if we make this window too big, the damage counter will be misleading, going to the wrong direction from the situation that really happens within the game.", "timestamp": 1791734661, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "kanapka8934_1", "author_id": "59503706624", "id": "18066786662786894", "text": "Hi Missan I need tips on how to learn to build a code like this and how to understand which part of code can do what since I have a problem with that", "timestamp": 1791364352, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "winged_haven_tales", "author_id": "70382234645", "id": "18020042687929878", "text": "First time here but i am sure i ll come back. Thank You so much for sharing! \ud83d\udd25\u2764\ufe0f Wish You all the best ^^", "timestamp": 1789570280, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "made41dream", "author_id": "78356644814", "id": "18350929717171303", "text": "beautifully done, and beautifully explained, thank you!\ud83d\ude4c", "timestamp": 1788300022, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "adridwitomo", "author_id": "9523010", "id": "18116096623958760", "text": "\ud83d\udc4f", "timestamp": 1788285572, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "floffyd", "author_id": "57204328661", "id": "18097173008038850", "text": "Awesome tuto @mii_misan ! Which fonts do you use for the numbers and for the small text at the bottom ? I would LOVE to use them for my game ! <3", "timestamp": 1787583075, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "_coop_copper", "author_id": "80046284816", "id": "18229028488320423", "text": "Which function should I use to do all of that? I only use dotween for now", "timestamp": 1787571916, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "synergyywastaken", "author_id": "46713687734", "id": "18368733451242447", "text": "The stacking and gravity work really poorly together I feel, if it stacks it should stick? But if it's grav it should fall. Just what I think", "timestamp": 1786885914, "like_count": 15}, {"author": "griffiigames", "author_id": "73499532778", "id": "18031321463841945", "text": "Definitely need to add some juice to the damage numbers in our typing game. Now they just look so boring compared to this!", "timestamp": 1786867404, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "straylights.studio", "author_id": "78375279226", "id": "18007213343949853", "text": "Hey, great and informative video! But I have a genuine question, as I myself don't enjoy any damage numbers popping in games. I can understand the numbers are appear slowly that you can actually track that. But what about games where those numbers are overused and occupy almost the whole screen, there is just so many that you cannot physically achieve that. What is the point for the player to have those appear? Is it some kind of mental reward? Is it more of an indicator/impact response? I really hate that fake mentality of something happening, but it's just my opinion haha", "timestamp": 1786852501, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "haydenjcm", "author_id": "399325670", "id": "17979350211114455", "text": "Awesome tutorial and fantastic design", "timestamp": 1786851435, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "julen.r6", "author_id": "3073630728", "id": "18109785094938938", "text": "Very useful man!", "timestamp": 1786832986, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "aukumox", "author_id": "77280650132", "id": "18279334819294486", "text": "Fortnite damage numbers.", "timestamp": 1786830803, "like_count": 5}, {"author": "joao.m_6", "author_id": "2951310170", "id": "18053984540790849", "text": "Yes Instagram this is what I want on my algorithm", "timestamp": 1786830773, "like_count": 1}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DcDs7f9uaqo/", "original_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DcDs7f9uaqo/", "webpage_url_basename": "DcDs7f9uaqo", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "playlist": null, "playlist_index": null, "thumbnail": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/772916433_18100847573214065_4950793621439804072_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_